      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "FULL VR EXPERIENCE (Headset On)\n\nYou are about to complete a fully immersive
    virtual reality learning activity.\n\nActivity Structure:\n\u2022 A series of
    infographic slides presented in a random order.\n\u2022 A short multiple-choice
    quiz designed to assess your understanding of the material.\n\nTiming:\n\u2022
    A timer is displayed in the top-left corner of each slide.\n\u2022 When the timer
    reaches zero, the next slide will automatically appear.\n\u2022 If a quiz question
    is not answered before time expires, it will be marked as incorrect.\n\nAdditional
    Features:\n\u2022 Throughout the activity, you will have access to an interactive
    3D model of the brain.\n\u2022 The model can be explored at any time to support
    your learning.\n\nControls:\n\u2022 Use the VR controllers to interact with both
    the educational content and the 3D brain model.\n\u2022 Review the content carefully
    and answer each question to the best of your ability."
